{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/1209402-shadow-and-psyche-concepts","id":1209402,"title":"Shadow and Psyche Concepts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-20T14:32:54-07:00","id":1209402,"title":"Shadow and Psyche Concepts","content":"I was playing around with some ideas for Wraith and I thought of some concepts for a Shadow and Psyche (for Specters) and we can share ideas.<br /> <br /> The Guru (Shadow)<br /> -Any Wraith can appreciate a little wisdom, but not from this Shadow. Posing as a patient wise man, it tries to guide the Wraith with the worst possible advice. When the Guru is in control, it will try to grant others its twisted wisdom in hopes that its victims will take it in the worst way possible.<br /> <br /> The Pal (Psyche)<br /> -It is the best friend you've ever had, supportive, kind and willing to lift you up when you are down. It's like your old drinking buddy or your childhood BBF. It wants nothing more than your happiness and well-being.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":1834,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","user":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","date":". 04-21-2018, 03:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T19:57:20-07:00","id":1209496,"title":"","content":"The Worshiper (Shadow)<br /> -Where other Shadows will wear you down with insults and cruelty, The Worshiper kills you with kindness. It makes the Wraith feel like she's the Shadow's world, a great thing that can do no wrong and all it wants to do is make her feel confident. Hopefully, when the Wraith's ego gets big enough, it will blind her from any potential downfalls a more grounded Wraith could avoid. When in control, The Worshiper will try to get others to adore and follow it so it can lead them into trouble. Even if the followers are sycophants, obsessed psychos, or users, all the better for the Wraith to put up with afterward.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T12:44:05-07:00","id":1209739,"title":"","content":"The Mother (Psyche)<br /> -Giving the unconditional love that the Spectre never had in life and unlife, The Mother is a gentle, loving being who comforts you when you're sad and lets you know that she cares. If you can accept her love, you could learn to love again as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T05:01:37-07:00","id":1213378,"title":"","content":"The Pal, and The Mother seem redundant with The Comrade, and The nurturer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}